	(descr "Recom REC10K-AW dual-output DIP 1in x 1in (25.4x25.4x10.2mm). Pin dia 0.6mm, recommended hole 1.0 (+0.15/0). Pad XY from DS Rev.2-2025 p.9 Recommended Footprint Details (top view); pin1 at (0,0), rotated so the input row is y=0. Dual: 1=+Vin 2=-Vin 3=CTRL 4=-Vout 5=COM 6=+Vout. NOTE: the hole pattern is identical to DKMW20F-15_1in_THT and the function at each hole matches; only the manufacturer pin numbering differs (industry-standard 1in 6-pin layout), so the two modules are physically interchangeable.")
